        "description": "<img src=\"https://assetsio.gnwcdn.com/core-Bethesda-IPs-custom.jpg?width=690&quality=85&format=jpg&auto=webp\" /> <p>Following weeks of rumours and speculation, Microsoft and Xbox have announced today around <a href=\"https://www.eurogamer.net/microsoft-xbox-layoffs-2026-double-fine-compulsion-ninja-theory\">3200 jobs are being cut before financial year 2027 ends</a>, with a number of studios being let go to find new owners or go independent. As more details pour out, we've also learned ZeniMax Media and <a href=\"https://www.eurogamer.net/companies/bethesda\">Bethesda Softworks</a> are facing cuts - even if no studios are closing. Moreover, there are new plans for their key properties moving forward.</p> <p><a href=\"https://www.eurogamer.net/zenimax-bethesda-new-plans-include-more-fallout-elder-scrolls-quake\">Read more</a></p>",
